# Facio API

Read `.cursor/skills/facio-api/SKILL.md` and `.cursor/skills/fastapi/SKILL.md` before writing the service.

```python
# ❌ BAD — model text becomes payload; pain ignored
widget.payload = json.loads(raw_llm)

# ✅ GOOD — validate against schema; pain gate before tools
patch = validate_talk_patch(raw)
```

- Depend on `facio_domain`. Keys stay on the server. `FACIO_MODEL_NAME` picks the vendor (`gpt-4o-mini` → OpenAI, `haiku` → Anthropic). Only the matching key is required.
- Do not use `fastapi-templates` (too large). No Postgres / RAG / broker in v1.
- Local run: Compose from repo root (`talk` :8000). Need `fastapi[standard]` if using `fastapi dev`.
- Goldens before widening tools. Lid execute must work with this service down.
